					"nextDialogs": [
						111120802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120802,
					"content": "好了，这样应该就没问题了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120803,
					"content": "我在霄灯里面写上了我们五个人的名字，其实每一年海灯节的时候，我们都会放一盏这样的灯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120804,
					"content": "不管今后的日子变成什么样，我们走上了什么不同的路，只要这个习惯还在，我们就没有变。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "聪子"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120805,
					"content": "至于狼哥的事，我们三个已经商量好，不会过问的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小五"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120806,
					"content": "但希望你们如果有机会的话，麻烦转告一下，我们一切都好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120807,
					"content": "而且，曾经说过的话，我们都已经实现了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120808,
						111120809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "木木"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120808,
					"content": "放心吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111120810,
					"content": "谢谢你们，我们会转达的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120811,
					"content": "有你们这样的朋友，狼哥一定会很感动的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111120809,
					"content": "「曾经说过的话」我也不会过问。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111120810
					]
				}
